# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D_1+ l- nu, D_1+ -> D+ gamma] gap mode (radiative)
# NickName: B0_D1lnu_Dgamma_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_1(2420)+ -> D+ gamma radiative decay, isospin partner of
#   decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/D1Dgamma (D_10 -> D0 gamma). Generated by the full-isospin
#   generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline. LLSW form factors as in the Bplus file;
#   VSP_PWAVE for the radiative sub-decay; SetLineshapePW references D_1+'s two isospin-allowed
#   D* pi channels (D*+ pi0, D*0 pi+) for width shape, mirroring the Bplus file's D*0 pi0/D*+ pi-.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias D1gamma0sig D_1+
Alias anti-D1gamma0sig D_1-
ChargeConj D1gamma0sig anti-D1gamma0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D1gamma0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D1gamma0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

SetLineshapePW D1gamma0sig D*+ pi0 2
SetLineshapePW D1gamma0sig D*0 pi+ 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1gamma0sig D*- pi0 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1gamma0sig anti-D*0 pi- 2

Decay D1gamma0sig
1.0   D+  gamma   VSP_PWAVE;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1gamma0sig

End
